                    {
                        "translation_id": "dba70d85-631f-4acf-8fb8-23a970389796",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b9201e5-acd8-3659-833f-c36f14d59578",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb600f7c-35ae-3509-b807-818416054462",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui comporte des pièges",
                        "target_lang_word": "verfänglich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "verfänglich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5a31733-3c76-346d-a81c-ecc096d7950b",
                                        "entry_id": "04c8ce2c-593c-3106-97ed-c16d53754786",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so beschaffen, dass man sich darin verfangen kann; Gefahren enthaltend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f44d487a-4f92-45a4-b3ac-fca9ff917319",
                                                "sense_id": "b5a31733-3c76-346d-a81c-ecc096d7950b",
                                                "text": "„So unduldsam sich dieses Jahrhundert auch dem Anschein nach gegenüber der ältesten aller Sünden zeigte, so wenig schreckte es davor zurück, sich in den verfänglichsten Labyrinthen der Liebe zu verlieren, die ausweglosesten Situationen zu erfinden, um zu erbarmungslosen Endlösungen zu kommen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9cf5948a-04c5-4c81-b8c1-926e5ed0f03a",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b9201e5-acd8-3659-833f-c36f14d59578",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb600f7c-35ae-3509-b807-818416054462",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui comporte des pièges",
                        "target_lang_word": "tricky",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tricky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hard to deal with, complicated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7a79d6f-7615-4e62-ab87-5cc6585a7988",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "They were in a tricky situation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6f4b0aa-82ea-47cd-b7fe-76ba57742dc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "Several types of diesel locomotive have been tested on this working and as a result the probable choice will be Type 2 diesels in pairs, without bankers. The crucial factor in the selection of this method is the higher degree of adhesion obtained than with a single Type 4; on trial one of the latter showed that in very adverse conditions it might slip to a standstill at one of the two tricky spots on the steep climb from Tyne Dock to Consett."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a9b563-63c9-4d05-8761-81531996bc7d",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "\"The trickiest we ever get,\" he continued, \"is in the short-answer questions like, 'Why do you want to come to the University of Chicago?' or, 'What books have you read?'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14b4ca2e-d692-4b44-b25f-5f2a71c8ad78",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "That will prove a trickier test, the management having pinpointed Oleh Blokhin's side as \"one of the favourites in the group\", though they will confront an England team buoyed by this battering."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "232fa869-e755-4561-8511-6f2658a6de05",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9a65c8-96da-346c-9c82-730df81c8958",
                                                "text": "It was as comfortable an afternoon as Arsène Wenger could have wished for in a situation that can be tricky in between internationals and the upcoming Champions League."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adept at using deception."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b1d85cc-cfbd-4480-93da-8bb721709ddf",
                                                "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                                "text": "Clever got me this far\nThen tricky got me in\nEye on what I'm after\nI don't need another friend"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99be29ca-e386-4678-806f-e3bfba9bf4a1",
                                                "sense_id": "61b7b141-791a-3085-8605-5e3f32bc83f3",
                                                "text": "A tricky salesman can sell anything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34312463-e39d-3659-9350-6a412d01bb4f",
                                        "entry_id": "666204c4-b7ef-373c-80db-fd8fab4c6a5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to or associated with a prostitution trick."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43bfc63-d20f-4e68-96f8-b009b6984619",
                                                "sense_id": "34312463-e39d-3659-9350-6a412d01bb4f",
                                                "text": "I don't want any of your tricky money, thank you!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35fd7fe1-8188-4721-8a76-1721fdfa6b56",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b9201e5-acd8-3659-833f-c36f14d59578",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb600f7c-35ae-3509-b807-818416054462",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui comporte des pièges",
                        "target_lang_word": "tricksy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tricksy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                        "entry_id": "a14fe4bc-c2d7-32be-a8f8-26789481f706",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inclined to trickery; sneaky, devious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbdea176-b845-4f52-9169-74aa05d811b2",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "My trickſey Spirit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa79bc4e-e84d-4f64-896a-5521258b915a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "There will succeed, therefore, in my opinion, and that too within no long time, to the rudeness and rusticity of our age, that ensnaring meretricious popularness in literature, with all the tricksy humilities of the ambitious candidates for the favourable suffrages of the judicious public, which if we do not take good care will break up and scatter before it all robustness and manly vigour of intellect, all masculine fortitude of virtue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "140c653d-273a-4244-8e74-0f2c7575207a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "A green light was flickering in his bulging eyes. ‘Masster, masster!’ he hissed. ‘Wicked! Tricksy! False!’ He spat and stretched out his long arms with white snapping fingers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6a8bba8-beb0-4900-9912-659468118d5d",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "As an experienced editor I disapprove of backflashes, foreshadowings and tricksy devices […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "023cff3c-5637-4bbc-8ec4-e2cec94644d8",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "The second section of the novel consists of “The Golden Vanity”, the New Yorker short story that prompted the narrator’s substantial advance, and which transposes names and details of the story and characters introduced in part one. This may seem tricksy in a way we’ve seen many times before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b2fbb43-62bb-4ad3-984b-171dac4fd4d7",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "“I know what you're trying to do. You're trying to smoke me out, you tricksy little bitches. Well, eat skata. Because I actually quite like this new company.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d54f484-6d39-4664-b37e-328dfec788f0",
                                                "sense_id": "7b0a4a42-a13c-3067-af2a-1431a2d53cf8",
                                                "text": "And that is exactly what he did: marrying tricksy European post-modernism with hard-boiled American noir, to create something dizzyingly inventive and new."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c3dd492c-5c9d-4afe-8331-1dbcc5a26fbd",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b9201e5-acd8-3659-833f-c36f14d59578",
